<title>USA: Green Tree Financial files f$2 bln shelf.</title>
<headline>Green Tree Financial files f$2 bln shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Green Tree Financial Corp said it filed a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission to sell up to $2 billion in certificates for home improvement and home equity loans.</p>
<p>When combined with a previous registration, Green Tree will have a total offering of $2,201,766,567 in loans available for sale, the filing said.</p>
</text>
